OL,3,AUS imposes sanctions on International
OL,4,ACriminal Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Trump administration has imposed
OL,7,Fsweeping sanctions on the International
OL,8,FCriminal Court (ICC), saying it wants
OL,9,Fto restrict the tribunal's resources
OL,10,Fand ability to operate.
OL,12,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio said
OL,13,Fthe measures - which include a ban on
OL,14,FUS entities making transactions with
OL,15,Fthe ICC - were intended to "defend US
OL,16,Fsovereignty" and accused the court of
OL,17,Fseeking to prosecute Americans.
OL,19,FThe ICC said the measures were an
OL,20,Fassault on the rule of law and the
OL,21,Ffoundations of the international legal
OL,22,Forder.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
